1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naruhito '''Naruhito''' (徳仁)] is the current Emperor of Japan. He acceded to the Chrysanthemum Throne on 1 May 2019, beginning the '''Reiwa''' era, following the abdication of his fat
2 CONC her, Emperor Akihito, on 30 April 2019. He is the 126th emperor according to Japan’s traditional order of succession.
